<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6659" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακαίω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακαιν-κάω</span></b> , aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέκαυσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Cyc.</u>
					383
				</span></i>
			:—<i>kindle, light up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥ οἱ πῦρ ἀνέκαιε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					7.13
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.145
			</span></i>, etc.:—
				Med.
			, <i>light oneself</i> a fire, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.202
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.19
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>kindle,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρεξιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.1089a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάχην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Chr.</u>
					23
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>fire up</i> with anger, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.19
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στάσις ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					9.27
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
